  3
IOR OF HOUSE IS TO BE PAINTED WHITE WITH 75MM OAK  BASE BOARD (SEE DETAIL) & 100MM OAK COVES AT ALL JUNCTIONS BETWEEN WALL & CEILING OR BEAMS & CEILING (SEE DETAIL).\P5.^IALL EXTERIOR WALL ARE TO BE 50MMX150MM FRAMING. INTERIOR WALLS ARE TO BE 50MMX1
